{"title":"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Convex quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c56ff6dcfd62e4e93c0469964d28b362ccff9c2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=3$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a5322c7f896502c208bbb4a354efc8d212620667.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f43e3d27fe9f4d0a322db6e6d2f1f28100e7e5cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b196f83c62ce83e5cb39f4d69af59fe42401f4da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/1/de1ad597f1289a99a95cedd21818dd99f87361e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC=90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" />, as shown. What is the area of the quadrilateral?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/6/ed685cbdb58e7beeff868e0123c51cd79633def7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A=(0,0), B=(-3,0), C=(-3,-4), D=(48/5,-36/5); draw(A--B--C--D--A);  label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,NW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SW); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,E); draw(rightanglemark(A,B,C,25)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"148\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ef3c2d971cdc20cdba2bba5b41445d13e0bb08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 30\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 36\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 40\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 48\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 58.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"408\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that by the pythagorean theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/b/edb20df9f4016a15bd68c2c0286c8b5e540ced58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />.  Also note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f105551f628f107282e0cc6c89063f3c1faece9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CAD$\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" /> is a right angle because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/8/fc8f59495796eb4b2416631af1682f18bfcfbf35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CAD$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> is a right triangle.  The area of the quadrilateral is the sum of the areas of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/8/fc8f59495796eb4b2416631af1682f18bfcfbf35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CAD$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> which is equal to \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/0/d60d5dac5538495750c4b3cbf16b14c243bd6d22.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{3\\times4}{2} + \\frac{5\\times12}{2} = 6 + 30 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 36}\\]\" width=\"280\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/4_x1sgcQCp4?t=923\">https://youtu.be/4_x1sgcQCp4?t=923</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B\">2014 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title